  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Shark Demon borrowed it specially to deal with the battlefield killer move freezing rain frozen earth, and paid a huge amount to a certain member of Zombie Alliance for it. With it, Shark Demon and the others greatly resist the power of freezing rain frozen earth, and even the desolate beast level snow monsters are obstructed. They expend far less immortal essence than they did last time. With it, Shark Demon can also move freely. The strong freezing rain frozen earth is greatly weakened once it meets the Gu. By the time the battlefield is unraveled, it has unleashed thirty-three attacks, and Melt Ice has held them back singlehandedly. The huge immortal essence expenditure greatly reduces Shark Demon’s joy at getting through the battlefield.",
